      "code": "if (!before)\n  buffer->copy_glyph ();",
      "note": "Root cause. The current-insert path treats `!before` as sufficient to copy a current glyph, but on the end-of-text entry there is no live current glyph. The vulnerable code omits the required `buffer->idx < buffer->len` guard before `copy_glyph()` and the matching `skip_glyph()` call, so it copies `info[len]` from uninitialized tail storage.",
